<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐστάθ-εια</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span> (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσταθ-ία</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IPE</u>
			12.91.11
		</span></i> (Olbia, <span class="entity">ii/iii A.D.</span>), poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσταθ-ίη</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			12.199
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Strat.
		</span></i>)), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stability, tranquillity</i>, coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐνομία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.248
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὰς πόλεις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				680
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ εὐσταθείας τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IPE</u>
					12.94.11
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Olbia</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Αἴγυπτον ἐν εὐ. διάγουσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					669.4
				</span></i>
			 (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐστάθειαν τῷ Βακχείῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1109.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. of <i>bodily health</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. σαρκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				424
			</span></i>, Olympic. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.56
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of persons,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσταθίη ἡ ἐν ἑωυτῷ</span>
			<i>self-possession</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Decent.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; <i>stedfastness, tranquillity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.33K.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.231
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν βουλαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.342f
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				21.20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; <i>steadiness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.65
				</span></i>
			.</div>
